  "id": "perceptual-learning",
  "term": "perceptual learning",
  "definition": "Perceptual learning is the improvement of perceptual judgments through practice or training. The improvement is often tied to the specific task or stimulus features being practiced, suggesting that learning can occur at relatively early stages of perception.",
